      "id": "bf2304aa36652845b22d",
      "title": "Scope and Discover Assets",
      "location": null,
      "url": "https://www.axonius.com/solutions/it-asset-discovery",
      "description": "IT Asset Discovery tools | Axonius | Axonius Axonius Named a Strong Performer in The Forrester Wave™: Proactive Security Platforms, Q3 2026 Read more Platform Solutions Customer Stories Resources Company Get a Demo Menu Scope and discover assets Establish a single source of truth with continuous IT asset discovery across your environment Get a Personalized Demo Product Tour See how security teams use Axonius to build a comprehensive asset inventory to gain full enterprise stack assurance. Asset discovery is the foundation every security decision is built on – and for most teams, that foundation is cracked. Security teams aren’t struggling with a lack of data. They can’t trust the data they have. Axonius turns asset discovery from a periodic, error-prone exercise into a continuously reconciled foundation - so your inventory reflects reality, not a spreadsheet. With Axonius, security teams get a complete view into what exists - the things you control, the things you don’t control (but should), and the things you can’t control. That confidence is what makes every downstream security decision faster and more defensible. Get a Personalized Demo Asset Discovery Without the Blind Spots Comprehensive asset inventory - Axonius connects to 1,400+ data sources - from endpoint agents and cloud providers to SaaS apps and identity and access management solutions - and correlates everything into a single, reconciled asset record. No more toggling between EDRs, cloud infrastructure, and IAMs to piece together a picture that’s already out of date Surface the unknown - known assets are only a part of the story. Axonius surface the unmanaged unknown, and ephemeral assets - cloud instances spun up daily, devices that fell out of agent coverage, inactive accounts - everything that traditional tools typically miss A foundation built to last - asset discovery isn’t point in time. Axonius continuously reconciles data cross sources so your inventory stays accurate as your environment changes, giving you the confidence to answer “what do we have and is it secure?” at any point in time Get a Personalized Demo The Asset Discovery Metrics That Tell You If Your Inventory Is Actually Working Asset inventory completeness Increase in total known assets discovered after connecting adapters to Axonius (for example, compare numbers in Axonius to your CMDB) Inventory recency Time elapsed between asset changes in your environment and changes in Axonius - a measure of how current your data is Unknown Asset Reduction Decrease in unmanaged or previously undiscovered assets identified using Axonius, reducing blind spots that create exploitable exposure See How Asset Discovery Tools Work in Axonius: From Connection to Action Step 1: See your full asset landscape Instantly get a complete view of assets in your environment, with dashboards and charts that have detailed breakdowns of assets in Axonius from each adapter, historical asset discovery trends, and characteristics like OS distribution, network appliances and more. You can even see which assets are unmanaged or previously unknown. Step 2: Connect data sources through API-based adapters Asset data in Axonius is entirely configured through API-based adapters - no agents, no scanners required. For example, the AWS adapter gives you the flexibility to pull in specific data like ECS and EKS clusters, VPNs, IAM groups, etc. Step 3: Build correlated, high-fidelity asset profiles As you configure adapters, Axonius builds an asset profile for every type of asset pulled into the platform. You’ll see details like MAC address, IP address, OS Type, Installed Software, OS Type and Version. These records are correlated across all adapters to give you a high-fidelity asset profile. Step 4: Take action from a single platform Visibility is great, but you need to take action on what you see. Using the Action Center, choose from over 600 actions across all adapters - send a notification, push files and commands, or open a ticket in your ITSM, isolate a device. Scope and discover assets: Axonius Adapters & integrations: Crowdstrike Tanium ServiceNow Active Directory Microsoft Entra AWS Google Cloud Flexera Microsoft 365 See all Adapters, and find documentation links Get Started See how to make asset intelligence actionable with a guided demo: Stop chasing data — work from one asset model your entire team can trust. See what's exposed before it's a problem — surface coverage gaps automatically. Turn alert noise into action — cut thousands of alerts down, to the ones that matter. Get a Demo Get Pricing New to Axonius? About our Platform Adapters Customer Stories Federal Systems Solutions Scope and Discover Assets Enhance CMDB Fidelity Fix Coverage Gaps Prioritize and Fix Exposures Strengthen Cyber Resilience Mobilize Incident Response Learn Events Blog Resource Center Documentation Company Who We Are Newsroom Trust & Security Modern Slavery Statement Partners Careers Contact Us The asset intelligence platform for taking intelligent action Privacy Policy Terms and Conditions Your privacy choices & cookies settings Do not sell or share my personal information Copyright © 2026 Axonius. All rights reserved. ricardo",
