      "id": "50b4573d018d497c1688",
      "title": "Enhance CMDB Fidelity",
      "location": null,
      "url": "https://www.axonius.com/solutions/improve-cmdb-data-quality",
      "description": "Improve CMDB Data Quality | Axonius | Axonius Axonius Named a Strong Performer in The Forrester Wave™: Proactive Security Platforms, Q3 2026 Read more Platform Solutions Customer Stories Resources Company Get a Demo Menu Enhance CMDB Fidelity Improve CMDB data quality with continuous asset reconciliation Axonius turns your CMDB from a static inventory into a trusted source of truth — continuously reconciled with what’s in your environment. Get a Personalized Demo Product Tour See how Axonius improves CMDB data quality by surfacing what's missing, correcting what's wrong, and keeping records accurate as your environment changes. CMDB data quality shouldn't depend on manual cleanup Your CMDB’s data quality degrades fast. Brittle discovery architectures can't keep up with rapidly changing environments, and manual reconciliation cycles guarantee your records are already stale by the time they're updated. Axonius helps teams continuously reconcile and enrich CMDB records with real-time asset data and metadata, so decisions, remediation, and automations are based on what actually exists — not assumptions. Security and IT get accurate ownership, context, and insights they can confidently act on. Get a Personalized Demo Why teams choose Axonius for CMDB accuracy Continuous CMDB accuracy without manual cleanups: Axonius eliminates the \"manual reconciliation loop\" by continuously validating and enriching asset records in real-time. This ensures that ownership, lifecycle state, and configuration data stay current as the environment changes, not just when a periodic scan runs. Unified model for Security and IT: Axonius aligns Security and IT onto a single operational baseline. By resolving the discrepancies between what security tools see and what the CMDB reports, teams stop debating data quality and start using the CMDB as a trusted backbone for audits, resilience, and modernization. Get a Personalized Demo The metrics that prove your CMDB data is actually accurate Mean Time to Reconciliation (MTTR) Total time saved by replacing manual cross-referencing and data cleanup with automated, continuous updates to CMDB records. Unmanaged Asset Discovery Rate Percentage reduction in shadow IT or unmanaged assets found through CMDB discovery in Axonius that were previously missing from the CMDB system of record. Data Enrichment Fidelity The average number of additional, high-context data fields (e.g., owner, business criticality, location) successfully populated in the CMDB per asset record. See how CMDB reconciliation works in Axonius Step 1: Build a trusted, correlated view of your asset landscape Getting true visibility into what actually exists in your environment, and all of the associated metadata, is the first step to strengthening your overall cyber resilience. Show connectors, data sources, and example data pulled from a source. Step 2: Determine assets in scope The Axonius Asset Cloud lets you easily visualize only the assets that need to be kept accurate in the CMDB, and build dashboards to track those assets over time. Step 3: Visualize CMDB asset gaps With an active connection to your CMDB, it’s straightforward to see which scoped assets already exist in the CMDB and which don’t. Step 4: Visualize CMDB asset inaccuracies Assets may exist in the CMDB and still have issues keeping associated metadata, like asset owner, lifecycle state, or IP address accurate over time. Step 5: Automate remediation Using the Action Center in Axonius, leverage an existing Enforcement Set to open a ticket to update the CMDB, or build a custom workflow to directly create or update a CI in the CMDB. Axonius adapters & integrations for CMDB data quality ServiceNow BMC JIRA OKTA Microsoft Entra InTune JAMF AWS GCP Azure Crowdstrike SentinelOne See all Adapters, and find documentation links Get Started See how to make asset intelligence actionable with a guided demo: Stop chasing data — work from one asset model your entire team can trust. See what's exposed before it's a problem — surface coverage gaps automatically. Turn alert noise into action — cut thousands of alerts down, to the ones that matter. Get a Demo Get Pricing New to Axonius? About our Platform Adapters Customer Stories Federal Systems Solutions Scope and Discover Assets Enhance CMDB Fidelity Fix Coverage Gaps Prioritize and Fix Exposures Strengthen Cyber Resilience Mobilize Incident Response Learn Events Blog Resource Center Documentation Company Who We Are Newsroom Trust & Security Modern Slavery Statement Partners Careers Contact Us The asset intelligence platform for taking intelligent action Privacy Policy Terms and Conditions Your privacy choices & cookies settings Do not sell or share my personal information Copyright © 2026 Axonius. All rights reserved. ricardo",
