      "description": "Exposure Management | Axonius | Axonius Axonius Named a Strong Performer in The Forrester Wave™: Proactive Security Platforms, Q3 2026 Read more Platform Solutions Customer Stories Resources Company Get a Demo Menu PRIORITIZE AND FIX EXPOSURES Focus exposure management on the vulnerabilities that actually matter Axonius unifies security findings across your tools, prioritizes the exposures that put you at risk, and drives vulnerability remediation from a single workflow. Get a Personalized Demo Product Tour See how security teams use Axonius for exposure management to move from 10k critical findings to the ones that require immediate action. Exposure management starts where vulnerability scanning stops Scanners tell you what's wrong — they don't tell you what matters. Without asset context , every CVE looks equally urgent, and remediation teams burn cycles on findings that pose minimal real risk. Axonius adds a durable context layer . By correlating findings from your scanners with asset ownership, business criticality, coverage status, and network exposure, Axonius helps your team focus on the vulnerabilities that actually put your business at risk. Get a Personalized Demo Why teams choose Axonius for exposure management Kill security silos: Stop managing tools; start managing risks. Our 1,400+ integrations across 40+ asset types ensure you see all assets and risks, from ground to cloud. Prioritize vulnerabilities that actually matter: Combine business, asset, and security signals to identify the security risks that require top priority — from a server with public access to your data science team's laptops. Mobilize with speed and confidence: Identify stakeholders automatically. Automate mobilization via ticket and direct remediation with 1,400+ integrations. Get a Personalized Demo Axonius customers reduce vulnerability management prioritization time by 70% and compliance reporting by 90%, saving $1.1M The Forrester Total Economic Impact™ of Axonius Cyber Asset Management 70% Reduction in vulnerability prioritization time. 90% Decrease in manual compliance reporting. $1.1M Total annual cost savings See how exposure management works in Axonius Step 1: Kill security silos Instantly get a complete view of assets and security risks in your environment. Step 2: Prioritize risks that truly matter Combine business, asset, and security context to identify the security risks that require prioritization. Step 3: Identify owners, track SLAs. Identify stakeholders automatically, with risk SLAs and additional context to turn objections into collaboration. Step 4: Drive action Automate mobilization and resolution aligned to your business: from tickets to workflows and direct remediation. Step 5: Future-proof your exposure management program Protect an environment that constantly evolves: whether the change is in what you need to protect, what security tools you use, or due to changes in business. Axonius adapters & integrations for exposure management AWS GCP VMWare Nutanix AD Okta Entra Tenable Qualys Rapid7 Wiz Orca VulnCheck Recorded Future Palo Alto Cisco F5. See all Adapters, and find documentation links Get Started See how to make asset intelligence actionable with a guided demo: Stop chasing data — work from one asset model your entire team can trust. See what's exposed before it's a problem — surface coverage gaps automatically. Turn alert noise into action — cut thousands of alerts down, to the ones that matter. Get a Demo Get Pricing New to Axonius? About our Platform Adapters Customer Stories Federal Systems Solutions Scope and Discover Assets Enhance CMDB Fidelity Fix Coverage Gaps Prioritize and Fix Exposures Strengthen Cyber Resilience Mobilize Incident Response Learn Events Blog Resource Center Documentation Company Who We Are Newsroom Trust & Security Modern Slavery Statement Partners Careers Contact Us The asset intelligence platform for taking intelligent action Privacy Policy Terms and Conditions Y