      "id": "e720f0c89e65d9f38e6c",
      "title": "Who We Are",
      "location": null,
      "url": "https://www.axonius.com/company",
      "description": "Who We Are | Axonius Axonius Named a Strong Performer in The Forrester Wave™: Proactive Security Platforms, Q3 2026 Read more Platform Solutions Customer Stories Resources Company Get a Demo Menu Who We Are Axonius transforms asset intelligence into intelligent action Axonius was founded in 2017 with one vision - to help you preemptively tackle hard-to-spot exposures, misconfigurations, and operational challenges across your entire technology footprint – all in one place, backed by one asset data model. Meet the Team The Axonius Asset Cloud streamlines the end-to-end lifecycle of all assets through our market-leading Adapter Network. We build a complete, accurate, and always up-to-date model of your entire attack surface, directing focus to the most critical actions with the right context to make smart data-driven decisions right-sized to your capacity. With a single platform covering cyber assets, software assets, SaaS applications, identities, infrastructure, and more, Axonius equips Security, IT, and GRC teams with total visibility and sharp actionability to continuously optimize mission-critical risk, performance, and cost measures – measures that every Board cares about. The actionability era of cybersecurity is here – time to bring truth to action with Axonius. Actionability Every asset, every relationship, ready for action Axonius builds a complete, accurate, and always up-to-date asset data model across your entire technology footprint, continuously bringing together data from all your devices, identities, applications, and infrastructure in one place. No other solution comes close to matching our breadth and depth of bidirectional integrations, giving us a lasting data advantage that unlocks actionability that would otherwise be impossible. One Hub Unified platform, deeply integrated Axonius provides a powerful platform that serves many critical use cases in one place – for continuously mitigating exposures, heightening security posture, meeting compliance guidelines, finding cost savings, and a whole lot more. You can only unify operations when you have a consistent data model across all functional areas – with our data advantage across functional areas, every use case becomes a 1+1=3 scenario. Truth to Action Clarity in action to drive certainty for the business Axonius provides an intuitive risk, performance, and cost model for all asset types, enabling teams to better quantify and prioritize efforts, with customizable dashboard, reports, and workflows that drive executive-level visibility and decision-making. Action depends on truth, but truth is very hard to come by with the status quo – we’ve proven that we bring a heightened level of confidence to the domain, making a measurable impact at the highest levels of the business. Work With Us Join our team We’re a passionate group of problem solvers. Innately curious, we’re excited about using technology to take on the toughest challenges in cybersecurity. View Jobs See Axonius in action See how to make asset intelligence actionable with a guided demo: Stop chasing data — work from one asset model your entire team can trust. See what's exposed before it's a problem — surface coverage gaps automatically. Turn alert noise into action — cut thousands of alerts down, to the ones that matter. Get a Demo Get Pricing New to Axonius? About our Platform Adapters Customer Stories Federal Systems Solutions Scope and Discover Assets Enhance CMDB Fidelity Fix Coverage Gaps Prioritize and Fix Exposures Strengthen Cyber Resilience Mobilize Incident Response Learn Events Blog Resource Center Documentation Company Who We Are Newsroom Trust & Security Modern Slavery Statement Partners Careers Contact Us The asset intelligence platform for taking intelligent action Privacy Policy Terms and Conditions Your privacy choices & cookies settings Do not sell or share my personal information Copyright © 2026 Axonius. All rights reserved. ricardo",
